#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
clk - CloakBrowser Manager (interactive TUI + CLI)

Manage many CloakBrowser (stealth Chromium) profiles, each with a persistent
fingerprint and its own proxy (local wireproxy SOCKS5 or purchased HTTP/SOCKS).

    $ clk
    clk> /new  [name]     new profile wizard (name -> proxy -> hw -> GPU)
    clk> /run  [name]     open browser (raw mode by default, no CDP)
    clk> /list            list profiles
    clk> /addproxy        add a purchased proxy (Webshare, etc.)
    clk> /proxies         show wireproxy + custom proxies

Direct CLI (no TUI):
    clk acc1                        # run with saved proxy
    clk acc1 --port 1091            # local SOCKS5 port
    clk acc1 --proxy http://user:pass@host:port
    clk acc1 --noproxy              # real IP
    clk addproxy 203.0.113.10:6014:user:pass
    clk login                       # save CloakBrowser license key (free works)
    clk --list | --doctor

First run (no license yet):
    python -m cloakbrowser login    # free key by email, 1 concurrent session
"""
